{"id":376,"date":"2010-07-19T06:49:26","date_gmt":"2010-07-19T06:49:26","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wordpress\/?p=376"},"modified":"2018-08-15T08:48:02","modified_gmt":"2018-08-15T08:48:02","slug":"71910-meeting","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2010\/07\/19\/71910-meeting\/","title":{"rendered":"7\/17\/10 Meeting"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>The attendance was light at the July 17th meeting with several members out of town.\u00a0 Vicki, N6KLS led a discussion on the draft Vision and Mission Statement.\u00a0 There were several suggestions and they will be incorporated into the second draft document.\u00a0 If you are on the mailing list you will see additional information in the coming weeks.<\/p>\n<p>As a reminder, if you are on the email mailing list you should have received the Vol. 1, Issue 1 July issue of the &#8220;Contra Costa Repeater Association WA6HAM Newsletter&#8221;.<\/p>\n<p>Thanks to everyone for attending the July Breakfast!<\/p>\n<p>For pictures, please continue reading.<\/p>\n<p><!--more--><\/p>\n\n\t\t<style type=\"text\/css\">\n\t\t\t#gallery-1 {\n\t\t\t\tmargin: auto;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-1 .gallery-item {\n\t\t\t\tfloat: left;\n\t\t\t\tmargin-top: 10px;\n\t\t\t\ttext-align: center;\n\t\t\t\twidth: 50%;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-1 img {\n\t\t\t\tborder: 2px solid #cfcfcf;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-1 .gallery-caption {\n\t\t\t\tmargin-left: 0;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\/* see gallery_shortcode() in wp-includes\/media.php *\/\n\t\t<\/style>\n\t\t<div data-carousel-extra='{\"blog_id\":1,\"permalink\":\"http:\\\/\\\/ccra.us\\\/2010\\\/07\\\/19\\\/71910-meeting\\\/\"}' id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-376 gallery-columns-2 gallery-size-thumbnail'><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='http:\/\/ccra.us\/2010\/07\/19\/71910-meeting\/p1090724\/'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/ccra.us\/wp-content\/uploads\/20